@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Get a CSRF token (send it as X-CSRF-TOKEN on POST/DELETE; keep the cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csrf

### Send a contact message / complaint (public, rate limited)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token>

{ "name": "Ann", "email": "", "subject": "Complaint", "message": "My donation did not show up." }

### Admin: list messages (requires admin session from /login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/messages?page=1

### Admin: delete a message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/messages/1
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token>
